          <td style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:center;">2.5 约束 + 2.6 派生 + 2.7 草图技巧</td>
          <td style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:center;">3</td>
          <td style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;text-align:center;">23</td>
